{
  "_readme": "The homepage is built from this ordered list. Each entry names a module in sitegen/sections/. Reorder entries to reorder the page; set \"enabled\": false to hide one; add an entry (plus a module file) to add a new section. `nav` is the label in the top bar (null = not in the nav). `title` is the section heading (null = no heading). A section whose module returns nothing is skipped automatically.",
